    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27411" root="طيب" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَيْبَةُ</span></b>  a name of <i>The city of the Prophet;</i> (S,
O, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَابَةُ</span></b> , (O, Msb, K,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الطَّيِّبَةُ</span></b> , and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُطَيَّبَةُ</span></b> , (K,) which last may be also
written ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُطَيِّبَةُ</span></b> . (TA.)

